{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":59,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["為安全求主施助"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["掃羅打發人窺探大衛的房屋，要殺他。那時，大衛作這金詩，交與伶長。調用休要毀壞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我的上帝啊，求你救我脫離仇敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我安置在高處，得脫那些起來攻擊我的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你救我脫離作孽的人","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和喜愛流人血的人！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"因為，他們埋伏要害我的命；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有能力的人聚集來攻擊我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，這不是為我的過犯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不是為我的罪愆。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我雖然無過，他們預備整齊，跑來攻擊我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你興起鑒察，幫助我！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之上帝－耶和華以色列的上帝啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你興起，懲治萬邦！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要憐憫行詭詐的惡人！（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"他們晚上轉回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫號如狗，圍城繞行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們口中噴吐惡言，嘴裏有刀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們說：有誰聽見？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"但你－耶和華必笑話他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要嗤笑萬邦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的力量啊，我必仰望你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為上帝是我的高臺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的上帝要以慈愛迎接我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝要叫我看見我仇敵遭報。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"不要殺他們，恐怕我的民忘記。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，你是我們的盾牌；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你用你的能力使他們四散，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"且降為卑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他們口中的罪和嘴裏的言語，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並咒罵虛謊的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們在驕傲之中被纏住了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你發怒，使他們消滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致歸於無有，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫他們知道上帝在雅各中間掌權，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到地極。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"到了晚上，任憑他們轉回；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任憑他們叫號如狗，圍城繞行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必走來走去，尋找食物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不得飽就終夜在外。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"但我要歌頌你的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"早晨要高唱你的慈愛；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你作過我的高臺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我急難的日子作過我的避難所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的力量啊，我要歌頌你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為上帝是我的高臺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是賜恩與我的上帝。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/59.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/60.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/58.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}